        position: absolute; width: 4px; height: 100%; background: #555; left: 50%;
        transition: transform 0.15s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.4, 1), background-color 0.2s; z-index: 2;
        box-shadow: 0 0 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
